# {{.Name}}

A TanStack Start web app scaffolded by SpecKit. Add routes under `app/routes/`.

UI components come from [rac-ui](https://github.com/markmals/racket-ui) (React Aria
Components + Tailwind v4 + cva + Tabler) via the shadcn CLI — they live under
`components/ui/` + `lib/`. Add more with
`pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add @racket-ui/<name>` (e.g. `card`, `dialog`, `input`).

- `mise run dev` — dev server
- `mise run test` — Vitest; a test is bound to a spec scenario by an
  `[scenario.<id>]` prefix on its `it(...)` title (see `app/lib/greeting.test.ts`).
- `mise run lint` — Oxlint · `mise run typecheck` — tsgo
- `mise run fmt` — Oxfmt (format `app/`) · `mise run fmt:check` — the CI check

`specify verify {{.Name}}` runs the tests and joins each scenario to its bound test.

In CI, `lint` / `typecheck` / `fmt:check` make up the **quality** job and `verify`
(the spec gate, which also runs `test`) makes up the **verify** job — both required.
